@startuml twinforge_conversion_pipeline

title TwinForge conversion pipeline
left to right direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "L5X specifications" as Specification
rectangle "Lossless XML capture" as Capture
rectangle "CapturedSection\nsource evidence" as Captured
rectangle "L5X parser and\nsource converters" as Parser
rectangle "Vendor-neutral\nmodel" as Model
rectangle "Analysis and\nenrichment" as Analysis
rectangle "Typed executable IR" as IR
rectangle "Target selection" as Target

Specification --> Capture : drives
Capture --> Captured : preserves all content
Captured --> Parser : interprets
Parser --> Model : resolves identity\nand relationships
Model --> Analysis
Analysis --> IR : executable semantics
Analysis --> Target : descriptive outputs
IR --> Target : executable outputs

note bottom of Captured
  Unknown attributes, elements, and
  source extensions remain available.
end note

note bottom of Model
  No CODESYS or OpenPLC
  representation types.
end note

@enduml
